#: imageplugins/channelmixer/channelmixer.cpp:142
#: imageplugins/colorfx/imageeffect_colorfx.cpp:125
#: imageplugins/whitebalance/imageeffect_whitebalance.cpp:141
#: imageplugins/adjustcurves/adjustcurves.cpp:149
