msgstr ""
"<p>Indique o nível de tinta para axustar a luminosidade da nova cor da "
"pupila."

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:405
msgid "Red Eyes Correction"
msgstr "Correción de ollos vermellos"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageplugin_sheartool.cpp:46
msgid "Shear..."
msgstr "Inclinar..."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:59
#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:71
#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:311
msgid "Shear Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de inclinación"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:73
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to shear an image."
msgstr "Unha extensión de digiKam para inclinar imaxes."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:82
msgid "Shear algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritmo de inclinación"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<p>This is the shearing image operation preview. If you move the mouse "
"cursor on this preview, a vertical and horizontal dashed line will be drawn "
"to guide you in adjusting the shearing correction. Release the left mouse "
"button to freeze the dashed line's position."
msgstr ""
"<p>Esta é a antevisión da operación de inclinación da imaxe. Se move o "
"cursor do rato nesta antevisión debuxarase unha liña discontinua vertical e "
"horizontal para guialo no axuste da operación de inclinación. Prema no botón "
"secundario do rato para fixar a posición das liñas discontínuas."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:112
msgid "Main horizontal angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo horizontal principal:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:117
msgid "<p>The main horizontal shearing angle, in degrees."
msgstr "<p>A ángulo de inclinación horizontal principal, en graus."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:119
msgid "Fine horizontal angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo horizontal fino:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:123
msgid ""
"<p>This value in degrees will be added to main horizontal angle value to set "
"fine adjustments."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor en graus será engadido ao ángulo horizontal principal para "
"permitir axustes finos."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:125
msgid "Main vertical angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo vertical principal:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:130
msgid "<p>The main vertical shearing angle, in degrees."
msgstr "<p>A ángulo de inclinación vertical principal, en graus."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:132
msgid "Fine vertical angle:"
msgstr "Ángulo vertical fino:"

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:136
msgid ""
"<p>This value in degrees will be added to main vertical angle value to set "
"fine adjustments."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor en graus será engadido ao ángulo vertical principal para "
"permitir axustes finos."

#: imageplugins/sheartool/imageeffect_sheartool.cpp:140
msgid ""
"<p>Enable this option to process anti-aliasing filter to the sheared image. "
"To smooth the target image, it will be blurred a little."
msgstr ""
"<p>Sinale esta opción para procesar un filtro de antialiasing (suavización) "
"na imaxe inclinada. Cando a suavice, a imaxe quedará lixeiramente difuminada."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:65
#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:72
msgid "Lens Distortion Correction"
msgstr "Correción da distorsión da lente"

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:74
msgid ""
"A digiKam image plugin to reduce spherical aberration caused by a lens to an "
"image."
msgstr ""
"Unha extensión de digiKam para reducir a distorsión esférica que introducen "
"as lentes na imaxe."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:88
msgid "David Hodson"
msgstr "David Hodson"

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:88
msgid "Lens distortion correction algorithm."
msgstr "Algoritmo de correción da distorsión das lentes."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:100
msgid ""
"<p>You can see here a thumbnail preview of the distortion correction applied "
"to a cross pattern."
msgstr ""
"<p>Aquí pode antever unha miniatura da correción da distorsión aplicada a un "
"patrón cruzado."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:110
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the amount of distortion. Negative values correct "
"lens barrel distortion, while positive values correct lens pincushion "
"distortion."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor controla a cantidade de distorsión. Os valores negativos "
"corrixen a distorsión por ancheamento da lente, mentres os valores positivos "
"corrixen a distorsión de estreitamento."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:116
msgid "Edge:"
msgstr "Marxe:"

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls in the same manner as the Main control, but has more "
"effect at the edges of the image than at the center."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor funciona do mesmo xeito que o control principal, pero ten máis "
"efeito nos extremos da imaxe que no centro."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:126
msgid "Zoom:"
msgstr "Ampliación:"

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:131
msgid "<p>This value rescales the overall image size."
msgstr "<p>Este valor muda o tamaño da imaxe total."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:135
msgid "Brighten:"
msgstr "Iluminar:"

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:140
msgid "<p>This value adjusts the brightness in image corners."
msgstr "<p>Este valor axusta o brillo nos cantos da imaxe."

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageeffect_lensdistortion.cpp:306
msgid "Lens Distortion"
msgstr "Distorsión de lentes"

#: imageplugins/lensdistortion/imageplugin_lensdistortion.cpp:46
msgid "Lens Distortion..."
msgstr "Distorsión de lentes..."

#: imageplugins/inpainting/imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:110
msgid "Inpainting Photograph Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de reparación de fotografías"

#: imageplugins/inpainting/imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:111
msgid "You need to select a region to inpaint to use this tool"
msgstr "Necesita escoller unha rexión a reparar para usar esta ferramenta"

