#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1075
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There is no enough free space on Camera Media to upload pictures.\n"
"\n"
"Space require: %1\n"
"Available free space: %2"
msgstr ""
"Non hai espazo libre de abondo na cámara para enviar as imaxes.\n"
"\n"
"Espazo requerido: %1\n"
"Espazo libre disponíbel: %2"

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1108
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Camera Folder <b>%1</b> already contains item <b>%2</b><br>Please enter a "
"new file name (without extension):"
msgstr ""
"O cartafol da cámara <b>%1</b> xa contén o ítem <b>%2</b><br>Por favor, "
"indique un novo nome de ficheiro (sen extensión):"

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1111
msgid "File already exists"
msgstr "Ese ficheiro xa existe"

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1167
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There is no enough free space on Album Library Path to download and process "
"selected pictures from camera.\n"
"\n"
"Estimated space require: %1\n"
"Available free space: %2"
msgstr ""
"Non hai espazo libre de abondo na rota da biblioteca de albuns para obter e "
"procesar as imaxes escollidas na cámara.\n"
"\n"
"Espazo requerido aprox: %1\n"
"Espazo libre disponíbel: %2"

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1208
msgid ""
"<p>Please select the destination album from the digiKam library to import "
"the camera pictures into.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Por favor, escolla o álbum de destino correcto na biblioteca de digiKam "
"para importar as imaxes da cámara nel.</p>"

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1467
msgid ""
"The items listed below are locked by the camera (read-only). These items "
"will not be deleted. If you really want to delete these items, please unlock "
"them and try again."
msgstr ""
"Os itens listados en baixo están bloqueados pola cámara (só leitura). Estes "
"itens non se borrarán. Se quere borrar realmente estes itens, por favor, "
"desbloquéea antes."

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1476 utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1543
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"About to delete this image. Deleted file is unrecoverable. Are you sure?"
msgid_plural ""
"About to delete these %1 images. Deleted files are unrecoverable. Are you "
"sure?"
msgstr[0] ""
"Está a piques de borrar esta imaxe. O borrado non é reversíbel. Desexa isto "
"realmente?"
msgstr[1] ""
"Está a piques de borrar estas %1 imaxes. O borrado non é reversíbel. Desexa "
"isto realmente?"

#: utilities/cameragui/cameraui.cpp:1534
msgid ""
"The items listed below are locked by camera (read-only). These items will "
"not be deleted. If you really want to delete these items, please unlock them "
"and try again."
msgstr ""
"Os itens listados en baixo están bloqueados pola cámara (só leitura). Estes "
"itens non se borrarán. Se quere realmente borrar estes itens, por favor, "
"desbloquéeos e ténteo de novo."

